WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.250
Ryu guards the late standing heavy punch.

2
00:00:02.250 --> 00:00:04.000
The throw follows the blocked heavy pressure.

3
00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:05.600
Standing medium punch and forward heavy punch reach the mined Ryu.

4
